as the first restaurant in Yorkshire to receive such a distinction) and was placed number 2 in the National Restaurant Awards Top 100 Restaurants. In 2022 the restaurant received fourth place in the Top 50 Gastropubs, with chef patron Michael Wignall being crowned 2022 Chef of the Year.\",\"_content\":\"field_69a583845aa24\",\"intro_section_button_0_button_link\":{\"title\":\"Discover More\",\"url\":\"http://localhost/punch-wp-angelathetton/ten-course-tasting-lunch/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_intro_section_button_0_button_link\":\"field_69a583db5aa26\",\"intro_section_button_0_aria_label\":\"Click AL\",\"_intro_section_button_0_aria_label\":\"field_69a583ec5aa27\",\"intro_section_button_0_button_google_event_label\":\"Click GA\",\"_intro_section_button_0_button_google_event_label\":\"field_69a583fe5aa28\",\"intro_section_button_0_button_class\":\"trans-black-btn\",\"_intro_section_button_0_button_class\":\"field_69a5840d5aa29\",\"intro_section_button_1_button_link\":{\"title\":\"Reserve a Table\",\"url\":\"https://webbooking.infodata.uk.com/Angel/WebBookingEngine/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_intro_section_button_1_button_link\":\"field_69a583db5aa26\",\"intro_section_button_1_aria_label\":\"Click AL\",\"_intro_section_button_1_aria_label\":\"field_69a583ec5aa27\",\"intro_section_button_1_button_google_event_label\":\"Click GA\",\"_intro_section_button_1_button_google_event_label\":\"field_69a583fe5aa28\",\"intro_section_button_1_button_class\":\"trans-black-btn\",\"_intro_section_button_1_button_class\":\"field_69a5840d5aa29\",\"intro_section_button\":2,\"_intro_section_button\":\"field_69a583995aa25\",\"background_image\":\"\",\"_background_image\":\"field_69a588bb5aa2a\",\"background_color\":\"\",\"_background_color\":\"field_69a588cd5aa2b\"},\"align\":\"full\",\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"60px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:60px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/left-right-media-content-sectio