ty that allows every ingredient on the plate to shine’.\",\"_content\":\"field_69a583845aa24\",\"intro_section_button\":\"\",\"_intro_section_button\":\"field_69a583995aa25\",\"background_image\":442,\"_background_image\":\"field_69a588bb5aa2a\",\"background_color\":\"\",\"_background_color\":\"field_69a588cd5aa2b\",\"margin\":{\"desktop\":{\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"linked\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"linked\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"linked\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"_margin\":\"field_69a699aef23f4\",\"padding\":{\"desktop\":{\"top\":\"60\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"60\",\"left\":\"\",\"linked\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"tablet\":{\"top\":\"50\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"\",\"linked\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"mobile\":{\"top\":\"40\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"\",\"linked\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"}},\"_padding\":\"field_69a699def23f5\"},\"align\":\"full\",\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/left-right-media-content-section {\"name\":\"acf/left-right-media-content-section\",\"data\":{\"show_left_side_image\":\"1\",\"_show_left_side_image\":\"field_69a57f529c686\",\"media_image\":372,\"_media_image\":\"field_69a582b55aa21\",\"title\":\"ROOMS \\u0026 SUITES\",\"_title\":\"field_69a582c45aa22\",\"heading_level\":\"h2\",\"_heading_level\":\"field_69a5830e5aa23\",\"content\":\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Aenean feugiat massa mattis egestas at quis nullam mattis. Ut in vitae sed eu accumsan egestas ut. Quis velit est nunc odio. Iaculis eu ut dignissim consequat dolor massa vel lorum.\\r\\n\\r\\nEgestas at erat leo massa purus convallis purus nunc. Nam sed faucibus amet phasellus leo tincidunt sed ac. Quam sollicitudin facilisis.\",\"_content\":\"field_69a583845aa24\",\"intro_section_button_0_button_link\":{\"title\":\"Discover More\",\"url\":\"http://loc