(1276, 1, '2026-04-20 09:51:45', '2026-04-20 09:51:45', 'Hand poured soy wax candle with a cotton wick and fine essential oils. Creating a moment: Burn for a minimum of 2 hours and a maximum of 4. This will ensure the wax burns evenly. Approximately 60 hours burn time.\n\nInfused with a delicate blend of pure essential oils to restore calm. With nurturing Rose Geranium, balancing Clary Sage, soulful Cedarwood and rejuvenating Lime essential oils your mind will be grateful for a moment of pure tranquility.\n<h3><strong>300ml | Hand poured in Yorkshire</strong></h3>', 'Botanical Candle', 'Hand poured soy wax candle with a cotton wick and fine essential oils. Creating a moment: Burn for a minimum of 2 hours and a maximum of 4. This will ensure the wax burns evenly. Approximately 60 hours burn time.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '663-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-04-20 09:51:45', '2026-04-20 09:51:45', '', 663, 'http://localhost/punch-wp-angelathetton/?p=1276', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
